  "description": "Alibaba Qwen provider for Mythosia.AI. Adds QwenService for DashScope, vLLM, and Ollama chat-completion endpoints, with streaming token usage, provider-specific reasoning controls, custom deployment names, ordered multi-function calls, and inherited Run output and cancellation controls. Chat only; native steering, hosted search, and image generation are not supported by this adapter. Requires Mythosia.AI 7.1.0.",
